= The Death of Hindenburg

President Paul von Hindenburg has passed away at age 86. An era of history is closing, and the future has never looked darker.

<span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Adolf Hitler**</span> is assuming the powers of the Presidency while retaining the office of Chancellor. This marks the final end of democracy in Germany.

- @kurwa: Well... this is bad.

